(6948911, 1047732, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great choice in camera position. Water flowing at the camera is always enticing.<br/> <br/>I might suggest you tune down the blue saturation to make the water more bright.</td>', 'Great choice in camera position. Water flowing at the camera is always enticing. I might suggest you tune down the blue saturation to make the water more bright.', '2013-01-04 10:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948912, 1047850, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of something something similar, if only I had the old tools. I like this.</td>', 'I was thinking of something something similar, if only I had the old tools. I like this.', '2013-01-04 10:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948913, 1047666, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good choice in locations for this type of shot.</td>', 'Good choice in locations for this type of shot.', '2013-01-04 10:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948914, 1047842, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this! Basic but an effective winter photo.<br/> <br/>Could use a bit of straightening.</td>', 'I like this! Basic but an effective winter photo. Could use a bit of straightening.', '2013-01-04 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948915, 1047799, 114225, '<td valign="top">Spectacular compositiion. Such a sentry of a building.</td>', 'Spectacular compositiion. Such a sentry of a building.', '2013-01-04 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948916, 1047760, 114225, '<td valign="top">That light on the left is a cool balance to the moon.<br/> <br/>I would suggest making sure to use a skew tool in post processing to remove the pincushion effect caused by the wide angle.</td>', 'That light on the left is a cool balance to the moon. I would suggest making sure to use a skew tool in post processing to remove the pincushion effect caused by the wide angle.', '2013-01-04 10:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948917, 1047649, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cool vantage point.</td>', 'What a cool vantage point.', '2013-01-04 10:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948918, 1047727, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the small down feel of this.<br/>Looks like there are some odd artifacts potentially from heavy noise reduction?</td>', 'I like the small down feel of this.Looks like there are some odd artifacts potentially from heavy noise reduction?', '2013-01-04 10:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948919, 1047805, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job capturing so much celebration in one photo.</td>', 'Fantastic job capturing so much celebration in one photo.', '2013-01-04 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948920, 1047494, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was looking for a scene like this, but never found one. I really like the photo.</td>', 'I was looking for a scene like this, but never found one. I really like the photo.', '2013-01-04 10:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948921, 1047716, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting that some of the buildings are blurry. Maybe some fog in the air?</td>', 'Interesting that some of the buildings are blurry. Maybe some fog in the air?', '2013-01-04 10:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948922, 1047835, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the way the exposure seems to frame this.</td>', 'I like the way the exposure seems to frame this.', '2013-01-04 10:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948923, 1047843, 114225, '<td valign="top">Always happy to see star trails. With that long of an exposure, I''m surprised that more of the foreground isn''t visible. But this is nice.</td>', 'Always happy to see star trails. With that long of an exposure, I''m surprised that more of the foreground isn''t visible. But this is nice.', '2013-01-04 10:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948924, 1047287, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot! the colors, while a bit over-saturated, are an important part to this image. And that dead tree with the little one (in the water on the right) balancing the scene is just perfect.</td>', 'I like this a lot! the colors, while a bit over-saturated, are an important part to this image. And that dead tree with the little one (in the water on the right) balancing the scene is just perfect.', '2013-01-04 10:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948925, 1047024, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is cool. Fire in the sky.</td>', 'This is cool. Fire in the sky.', '2013-01-04 10:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948926, 1046839, 114225, '<td valign="top">Normally I''m not a fan of faded people shots, but this one works so well. I think it''s her clothing that really nails the shot.</td>', 'Normally I''m not a fan of faded people shots, but this one works so well. I think it''s her clothing that really nails the shot.', '2013-01-04 10:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948927, 1047507, 114225, '<td valign="top">Magnificent job framing the wheel with the curve of the statue.</td>', 'Magnificent job framing the wheel with the curve of the statue.', '2013-01-04 10:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948953, 1047845, 61396, '<td valign="top">Darcy and Sophie I presume?! great walk result.</td>', 'Darcy and Sophie I presume?! great walk result.', '2013-01-04 12:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948962, 1047562, 63218, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view, nice crop.</td>', 'Nice point of view, nice crop.', '2013-01-04 12:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948965, 1047854, 63218, '<td valign="top">Holy cow! if I could vote 10 twice, I would! Are you OK? I hope you are standing at the end of a pedestrian walkway or some other auto-free zone to get this. Extra points for crazy-photographer behavior resulting in an awesome capture. Huzzah!</td>', 'Holy cow! if I could vote 10 twice, I would! Are you OK? I hope you are standing at the end of a pedestrian walkway or some other auto-free zone to get this. Extra points for crazy-photographer behavior resulting in an awesome capture. Huzzah!', '2013-01-04 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948967, 1047846, 63218, '<td valign="top">It''s all blurred. I <u>love</u> it! And it looks great in thumbnail size as well. If this was hanging on the wall in a gallery or museum I would feel compelled to walk across the room right up to it, to inspect the details closely.</td>', 'It''s all blurred. I love it! And it looks great in thumbnail size as well. If this was hanging on the wall in a gallery or museum I would feel compelled to walk across the room right up to it, to inspect the details closely.', '2013-01-04 12:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948972, 1047822, 63218, '<td valign="top">Fascinating natural abstract. Love it &amp; the clear, crisp contrast--instant fav.</td>', 'Fascinating natural abstract. Love it & the clear, crisp contrast--instant fav.', '2013-01-04 12:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948977, 1047649, 92577, '<td valign="top">Not the usual view of hong kong. Very intresting perspective.</td>', 'Not the usual view of hong kong. Very intresting perspective.', '2013-01-04 12:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948980, 1047024, 92577, '<td valign="top">Great light.</td>', 'Great light.', '2013-01-04 12:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948981, 1047832, 153814, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this shot was boring but I found myself looking at this for a long time. Turns out it''s alot more interesting than I thought.<br/>My eyes like to took at it but my brain doesn''t know why.<br/>Sorry for the ridiculous comment.<br/>One of my top picks.</td>', 'At first I thought this shot was boring but I found myself looking at this for a long time. Turns out it''s alot more interesting than I thought.My eyes like to took at it but my brain doesn''t know why.Sorry for the ridiculous comment.One of my top picks.', '2013-01-04 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948993, 1047844, 63218, '<td valign="top">Excellent! This is my idea of street photography.  It''s odd how when multiple images are combined, even in-camera, my perception of time is distorted, stretched, torn from the finished composition. It''s as if I can see parallel realities all at once, instead of one at a time, like I''m used to. The BW tones are perfect. Good job.</td>', 'Excellent! This is my idea of street photography.  It''s odd how when multiple images are combined, even in-camera, my perception of time is distorted, stretched, torn from the finished composition. It''s as if I can see parallel realities all at once, instead of one at a time, like I''m used to. The BW tones are perfect. Good job.', '2013-01-04 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6948996, 1047451, 63218, '<td valign="top">Oh how pretty, the light is like cold honey dripping through the blades of grass. It''s blurred, with sharp contrasts. Love it!</td>', 'Oh how pretty, the light is like cold honey dripping through the blades of grass. It''s blurred, with sharp contrasts. Love it!', '2013-01-04 13:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949002, 1047858, 63218, '<td valign="top">Beautifully blurred light combined with clear shadows. I am impressed.</td>', 'Beautifully blurred light combined with clear shadows. I am impressed.', '2013-01-04 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949004, 1047507, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is fun to look at. Even after I figured out it''s a fish, I can still go back &amp; figure it out again. The way it''s posed w/the blue wheel is just perfect. Well done.</td>', 'This is fun to look at. Even after I figured out it''s a fish, I can still go back & figure it out again. The way it''s posed w/the blue wheel is just perfect. Well done.', '2013-01-04 13:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949060, 1047836, 138253, '<td valign="top">i see the 30.25 seconds on the clock, but it''s all very crisp. i doubt this was a 30+ second exposure.</td>', 'i see the 30.25 seconds on the clock, but it''s all very crisp. i doubt this was a 30+ second exposure.', '2013-01-04 14:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949061, 1047805, 138253, '<td valign="top">love the look of fireworks all over the city! Fantastic!</td>', 'love the look of fireworks all over the city! Fantastic!', '2013-01-04 15:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949063, 1047822, 138253, '<td valign="top">very ominous feeling.<br/>cold and dark... looks like it should be the jack image for a murder mystery book/movie</td>', 'very ominous feeling.cold and dark... looks like it should be the jack image for a murder mystery book/movie', '2013-01-04 15:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949064, 1047696, 138253, '<td valign="top">love the detail here, the shadows and light, it''s a superb job</td>', 'love the detail here, the shadows and light, it''s a superb job', '2013-01-04 15:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949066, 1047810, 138253, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, love the purple sky - such a great shade....</td>', 'Fantastic image, love the purple sky - such a great shade....', '2013-01-04 15:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949094, 1046872, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of long term exposure that photographers don''t think of. When you think about it, clouds are similar to flowing water - the same technique can be used for moving clouds when the light is right.  This is terrific just for technical competence and worthy of a ten just because of the innovative exposure and pleasing color space. Well done.</td>', 'This is the kind of long term exposure that photographers don''t think of. When you think about it, clouds are similar to flowing water - the same technique can be used for moving clouds when the light is right.  This is terrific just for technical competence and worthy of a ten just because of the innovative exposure and pleasing color space. Well done.', '2013-01-04 15:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949095, 1047507, 54446, '<td valign="top">Easily my favorite in this challenge.  Great complementary colors.  Stunning juxtaposition of the fish statue and the twirling wheel.  Strong eye-appeal.  An inspiring image.  I expect this will be a ribbon contender.  10</td>', 'Easily my favorite in this challenge.  Great complementary colors.  Stunning juxtaposition of the fish statue and the twirling wheel.  Strong eye-appeal.  An inspiring image.  I expect this will be a ribbon contender.  10', '2013-01-04 15:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949096, 1047843, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty good Polaris and star trails.  The foreground illumination by the moon is a bonus.  9</td>', 'Pretty good Polaris and star trails.  The foreground illumination by the moon is a bonus.  9', '2013-01-04 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949097, 1047799, 54446, '<td valign="top">Gothic structure and streaming clouds make for a moody image.  I especially like the view down to the valley where city lights show.  Effective composition.  8</td>', 'Gothic structure and streaming clouds make for a moody image.  I especially like the view down to the valley where city lights show.  Effective composition.  8', '2013-01-04 15:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949098, 1047822, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great job on the shiny ice with highlights.  The water flowing by is nicely smoothed to silk.  7</td>', 'Great job on the shiny ice with highlights.  The water flowing by is nicely smoothed to silk.  7', '2013-01-04 15:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949099, 1047696, 54446, '<td valign="top">Outstanding night bridge shot.  The star bursts on the lights are a big plus.  8</td>', 'Outstanding night bridge shot.  The star bursts on the lights are a big plus.  8', '2013-01-04 15:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949100, 1047437, 54446, '<td valign="top">Southern hemisphere according to the startrails.  Excellent smoothing of the surf in the moonlight.   8</td>', 'Southern hemisphere according to the startrails.  Excellent smoothing of the surf in the moonlight.   8', '2013-01-04 15:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949101, 1046872, 54446, '<td valign="top">Alpenglow light.  Well seen and captured.  Great supporting clouds over the peaks.  Nothing easy about this shot.  9</td>', 'Alpenglow light.  Well seen and captured.  Great supporting clouds over the peaks.  Nothing easy about this shot.  9', '2013-01-04 15:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949115, 1047658, 124190, '<td valign="top">her furrrrrrrr is blurrrrrrry from her breath.......very subtle.. :-)...nice couch!    Love this!</td>', 'her furrrrrrrr is blurrrrrrry from her breath.......very subtle.. :-)...nice couch!    Love this!', '2013-01-04 15:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949117, 1047845, 124190, '<td valign="top">very wonderful     I love what I think looks like the leash......   I feel them moving.........   my favorite.....</td>', 'very wonderful     I love what I think looks like the leash......   I feel them moving.........   my favorite.....', '2013-01-04 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949118, 1047645, 124190, '<td valign="top">great concept....super pic......</td>', 'great concept....super pic......', '2013-01-04 16:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949121, 1047854, 124190, '<td valign="top">Harshly beautiful.......I hear hear this too!</td>', 'Harshly beautiful.......I hear hear this too!', '2013-01-04 16:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949123, 1047842, 101256, '<td valign="top">One of the problems with photographing falling snow is....falling snow. In this case it works because of the nature of the lighting.  I particularly like the snow''s texture and it''s granular nature. The conversion,a tough one with snow, is well done. Good job overall.</td>', 'One of the problems with photographing falling snow is....falling snow. In this case it works because of the nature of the lighting.  I particularly like the snow''s texture and it''s granular nature. The conversion,a tough one with snow, is well done. Good job overall.', '2013-01-04 16:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949125, 1047465, 54446, '<td valign="top">Looks just right for a 10 second exposure.  Those moonlit clouds were moving.  I like your image, but it would be better with at least one more element of interest.</td>', 'Looks just right for a 10 second exposure.  Those moonlit clouds were moving.  I like your image, but it would be better with at least one more element of interest.', '2013-01-04 16:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949126, 1047810, 101256, '<td valign="top">A unique perspective and gorgeous colors make this a great image - it''s very subtle color range is a real positive. The change in perspective on the highway bridge is also a plus.  Very nice image - very pleasing.</td>', 'A unique perspective and gorgeous colors make this a great image - it''s very subtle color range is a real positive. The change in perspective on the highway bridge is also a plus.  Very nice image - very pleasing.', '2013-01-04 16:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949127, 1047799, 124190, '<td valign="top">very spooky!!!!!! I''m waiting for a monster to come over the hill!!!!    whooooosssssshhhhhHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'very spooky!!!!!! I''m waiting for a monster to come over the hill!!!!    whooooosssssshhhhhHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2013-01-04 16:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949128, 1047716, 124190, '<td valign="top">so futuristic........</td>', 'so futuristic........', '2013-01-04 16:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949131, 1047845, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the author recognizes, or even intended this to be, abstract expressionism in the style of Jackson Pollock, but it is a great example of the genre. I enjoy abstract art and photography - manipulated or not. The title gives the image purpose.  Probably not going to score high, but it''s a favorite for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the author recognizes, or even intended this to be, abstract expressionism in the style of Jackson Pollock, but it is a great example of the genre. I enjoy abstract art and photography - manipulated or not. The title gives the image purpose.  Probably not going to score high, but it''s a favorite for me.', '2013-01-04 16:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949132, 1047645, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of multiple images - certainly meets the criteria of the challenge in a unique way. I like it.</td>', 'Very interesting use of multiple images - certainly meets the criteria of the challenge in a unique way. I like it.', '2013-01-04 16:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949134, 1047858, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of abstract art and much like an earlier image, this is also a very good example of Abstract Expressionism. There is a very empyrean to this that I am quite impressed with. Don''t know if this was intended or not (the title would seem to indicate it was), but I sure as hell like it a lot. Great color space and a wonderful impression.  A ten for me - others probably not. Well done.</td>', 'I''m a big fan of abstract art and much like an earlier image, this is also a very good example of Abstract Expressionism. There is a very empyrean to this that I am quite impressed with. Don''t know if this was intended or not (the title would seem to indicate it was), but I sure as hell like it a lot. Great color space and a wonderful impression.  A ten for me - others probably not. Well done.', '2013-01-04 16:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949135, 1047562, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is not your ordinary time lapse - there is a big element of artistic competence from the streaking lights to the stainless rails to the individual spot lights.  I also like the fact that the white lighting isn''t blown out which is a tendency for some on long exposures.  Well done - very nice image.</td>', 'This is not your ordinary time lapse - there is a big element of artistic competence from the streaking lights to the stainless rails to the individual spot lights.  I also like the fact that the white lighting isn''t blown out which is a tendency for some on long exposures.  Well done - very nice image.', '2013-01-04 16:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949146, 1047507, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and control of exposure</td>', 'Excellent composition and control of exposure', '2013-01-04 17:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949151, 1047854, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the chaotic nature of the lights and the crazy contrast in the bridge</td>', 'i love the chaotic nature of the lights and the crazy contrast in the bridge', '2013-01-04 17:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949153, 1047729, 67152, '<td valign="top">very cool use of light</td>', 'very cool use of light', '2013-01-04 17:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949155, 1047799, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great use of long exposure to create the smoothness in the sky to contrast the details and textures in the land...and that path...way cool</td>', 'Great use of long exposure to create the smoothness in the sky to contrast the details and textures in the land...and that path...way cool', '2013-01-04 17:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949156, 1047705, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is one huge problem with this and that is the shadow. I understand the concept and the subject, but the shadow just looks like a smudge and not the lingering image of a spirit. A little more definition with the spirit subject would have made this an outstanding image.</td>', 'There is one huge problem with this and that is the shadow. I understand the concept and the subject, but the shadow just looks like a smudge and not the lingering image of a spirit. A little more definition with the spirit subject would have made this an outstanding image.', '2013-01-04 17:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949157, 1047481, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yes - yes they are. Not a terribly interesting image - the color is rather drab and the subject matter is...well, dull and rather commonplace. Sorry - it just doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Yes - yes they are. Not a terribly interesting image - the color is rather drab and the subject matter is...well, dull and rather commonplace. Sorry - it just doesn''t do anything for me.', '2013-01-04 17:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949158, 1047751, 101256, '<td valign="top">Cool - I''ve been there. Ok,now that the pleasantries are over with...  :&gt;)<br/> <br/>This is a great idea and frankly a little more definition with fewer cars would have been better frankly - the "ghost" images just look like a jumbled mess.</td>', 'Cool - I''ve been there. Ok,now that the pleasantries are over with...  :>) This is a great idea and frankly a little more definition with fewer cars would have been better frankly - the "ghost" images just look like a jumbled mess.', '2013-01-04 17:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949159, 1047850, 67152, '<td valign="top">very nice light painting - the ''warm spots'' on the wood table/floor add a nice level of depth to the image</td>', 'very nice light painting - the ''warm spots'' on the wood table/floor add a nice level of depth to the image', '2013-01-04 17:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949160, 1047810, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the colors and the smoothness throughout - but not sure about the off centered lean of the bridge to the right</td>', 'love the colors and the smoothness throughout - but not sure about the off centered lean of the bridge to the right', '2013-01-04 17:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
