(6949203, 1047507, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out what that is, but I like the clever title - I''ll bet not many will get it.  You need a fisherman I guess to get it. Nice job - I like it - a nine for the image and a nine for the title. Well done.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out what that is, but I like the clever title - I''ll bet not many will get it.  You need a fisherman I guess to get it. Nice job - I like it - a nine for the image and a nine for the title. Well done.', '2013-01-04 18:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949204, 1047855, 101256, '<td valign="top">This has a faded photograph feel to it - not sure if it was intentional or not. If not, the conversion needed a little more work to improve the contrasts - the gray scale needs more depth.</td>', 'This has a faded photograph feel to it - not sure if it was intentional or not. If not, the conversion needed a little more work to improve the contrasts - the gray scale needs more depth.', '2013-01-04 18:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949205, 1047680, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - I assume it was hand held and post processed to get the overall effect. It looks like a Stratocaster, but there appears to be a different headstock logo to it. Anyway, this is great - I love it. Then again, I''m a big guitar guy. Very nice.</td>', 'I like this a lot - I assume it was hand held and post processed to get the overall effect. It looks like a Stratocaster, but there appears to be a different headstock logo to it. Anyway, this is great - I love it. Then again, I''m a big guitar guy. Very nice.', '2013-01-04 18:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949206, 1047649, 101256, '<td valign="top">The whites are blown through all over the image and that is very distracting. It might have been better to concentrate on one aspect of this rather than the whole.</td>', 'The whites are blown through all over the image and that is very distracting. It might have been better to concentrate on one aspect of this rather than the whole.', '2013-01-04 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
