(6949522, 1047799, 118154, '<td valign="top">Real nice compostion makes for a good image..</td>', 'Real nice compostion makes for a good image..', '2013-01-05 11:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949523, 1047494, 118154, '<td valign="top">Love this, hope to see it high up.</td>', 'Love this, hope to see it high up.', '2013-01-05 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949524, 1047845, 118154, '<td valign="top">What a pair.</td>', 'What a pair.', '2013-01-05 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949539, 1046839, 136989, '<td valign="top">A very appropriate place for a ghost-like image. The white of the snow is almost too intense but it works here.</td>', 'A very appropriate place for a ghost-like image. The white of the snow is almost too intense but it works here.', '2013-01-05 11:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949541, 1047860, 136989, '<td valign="top">There''s a slight tilt to the horizon that detracts a little but very colorful and I really like the reflection details.</td>', 'There''s a slight tilt to the horizon that detracts a little but very colorful and I really like the reflection details.', '2013-01-05 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949544, 1047265, 136989, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous!  A wonderful place captured in gorgeous detail and color.  I''d really love to visit.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous!  A wonderful place captured in gorgeous detail and color.  I''d really love to visit.', '2013-01-05 11:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949546, 1047507, 136989, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is but it captures my eye and I keep staring.  It''s quite beautiful actually.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is but it captures my eye and I keep staring.  It''s quite beautiful actually.', '2013-01-05 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949547, 1047799, 136989, '<td valign="top">This picture draws me in ... I really want to follow the path toward the city in the distance, taking pictures of the stone sentinel on the hill along the way.  The b/w definitely works here but I''d love to see what the colors were.</td>', 'This picture draws me in ... I really want to follow the path toward the city in the distance, taking pictures of the stone sentinel on the hill along the way.  The b/w definitely works here but I''d love to see what the colors were.', '2013-01-05 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949620, 1047854, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. The colors are amazing (especially the gradients in the sky). Composition is superb... off center just enough to not be boring, shows off the sky, signal is in the right place (if you are into rules), the lamps near the center are great, splash of graffiti always helps urban scenes. I really like the rusty, crusty, high-local-contrast texture of the bridge structure, and it practically glows off my screen. Great lines, great motion.<br/> <br/>I''d imagine some might complain because this space calls for it that it''s overcooked, but I find everything to work together in a wonderful way.</td>', 'This is fantastic. The colors are amazing (especially the gradients in the sky). Composition is superb... off center just enough to not be boring, shows off the sky, signal is in the right place (if you are into rules), the lamps near the center are great, splash of graffiti always helps urban scenes. I really like the rusty, crusty, high-local-contrast texture of the bridge structure, and it practically glows off my screen. Great lines, great motion. I''d imagine some might complain because this space calls for it that it''s overcooked, but I find everything to work together in a wonderful way.', '2013-01-05 13:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949710, 1047843, 109387, '<td valign="top">The startrail works even if the whole scene is not very interesting. I don''t know how it can score and I''m curious to see it at rollover :)</td>', 'The startrail works even if the whole scene is not very interesting. I don''t know how it can score and I''m curious to see it at rollover :)', '2013-01-05 15:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949713, 1047705, 109387, '<td valign="top">This image had great potential. But it''s extremely dark and the shadow movement doesn''t <i>tell a story</i>. Probably you had to study more carefully that aspect of your shot.<br/> <br/>ETA: there''s a dust spot on the left</td>', 'This image had great potential. But it''s extremely dark and the shadow movement doesn''t tell a story. Probably you had to study more carefully that aspect of your shot. ETA: there''s a dust spot on the left', '2013-01-05 15:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949715, 1047265, 109387, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and peaceful scene</td>', 'Beautiful and peaceful scene', '2013-01-05 15:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949716, 1047166, 109387, '<td valign="top">One of best images of this challenge!</td>', 'One of best images of this challenge!', '2013-01-05 15:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949718, 1047658, 109387, '<td valign="top">I can believe this is a 30+ seconds exposure, but the long exposure doesn''t add anything to this shot. Probably in BW would be more interesting</td>', 'I can believe this is a 30+ seconds exposure, but the long exposure doesn''t add anything to this shot. Probably in BW would be more interesting', '2013-01-05 15:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949720, 1046839, 109387, '<td valign="top">Great concept... hope it can get the score it deserves!</td>', 'Great concept... hope it can get the score it deserves!', '2013-01-05 15:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949721, 1047799, 109387, '<td valign="top">The editing is too strong for my taste but it''s a stunning view and the composition works</td>', 'The editing is too strong for my taste but it''s a stunning view and the composition works', '2013-01-05 15:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949722, 1047822, 109387, '<td valign="top">A frozen and dark world - one of my favorites!</td>', 'A frozen and dark world - one of my favorites!', '2013-01-05 15:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949723, 1046879, 109387, '<td valign="top">IMO this is a top 5. Nice foreground and dramatic sky</td>', 'IMO this is a top 5. Nice foreground and dramatic sky', '2013-01-05 15:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949724, 1047024, 109387, '<td valign="top">The sky is amazing but there''s too black below it. With another composition it could get a very good score</td>', 'The sky is amazing but there''s too black below it. With another composition it could get a very good score', '2013-01-05 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949725, 1047507, 109387, '<td valign="top">Amazing composition!</td>', 'Amazing composition!', '2013-01-05 15:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949741, 1047287, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting combination of color and texture. The light touch of pink on the water looks very pleasant and peaceful.  That said, it''s not a terribly interesting image rocks, water, sky with what appears to be a dead tree. It also looks to be slightly over sharpened - just a touch over what was necessary. Still, a pleasant snapshot.</td>', 'An interesting combination of color and texture. The light touch of pink on the water looks very pleasant and peaceful.  That said, it''s not a terribly interesting image rocks, water, sky with what appears to be a dead tree. It also looks to be slightly over sharpened - just a touch over what was necessary. Still, a pleasant snapshot.', '2013-01-05 15:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949743, 1047854, 101256, '<td valign="top">This has an interesting HDR feel to it, but not to my taste - the whole image just seems to be over done. A little less earth tone would work better I think.</td>', 'This has an interesting HDR feel to it, but not to my taste - the whole image just seems to be over done. A little less earth tone would work better I think.', '2013-01-05 15:53:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6949760, 1047657, 101256, '<td valign="top">I would really like to rate this high, but unfortunately all the interesting stuff is in the back ground. The cloud formation is nice, but there just isn''t any real WOW factor to this image.</td>', 'I would really like to rate this high, but unfortunately all the interesting stuff is in the back ground. The cloud formation is nice, but there just isn''t any real WOW factor to this image.', '2013-01-05 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949763, 1047024, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author missed a great opportunity here to grab a great image by keeping the shutter open longer and getting more foreground. It would have had an orange cast to it what would have been really striking. Still, it''s an interesting image.</td>', 'The author missed a great opportunity here to grab a great image by keeping the shutter open longer and getting more foreground. It would have had an orange cast to it what would have been really striking. Still, it''s an interesting image.', '2013-01-05 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949767, 1047465, 101256, '<td valign="top">You can tell this was a thirty second image because the stars are a little elongated. But, and this is opinion, a longer exposure with a tighter aperture and more star trails would have made this a much better image.</td>', 'You can tell this was a thirty second image because the stars are a little elongated. But, and this is opinion, a longer exposure with a tighter aperture and more star trails would have made this a much better image.', '2013-01-05 16:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949769, 1047832, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ve often railed against the effect titles have on images, but this just begs for a different title - something about time warps or wormholes - that kind of thing. Very interesting image - maybe a little closer look at the dashboard and driver/passenger might have helped a little more.</td>', 'I''ve often railed against the effect titles have on images, but this just begs for a different title - something about time warps or wormholes - that kind of thing. Very interesting image - maybe a little closer look at the dashboard and driver/passenger might have helped a little more.', '2013-01-05 16:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949776, 1047696, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really like images where the hot spots (in this case the lights) are right on the edge of being over done. All the lighting just enhance what is already a great image. Well done.</td>', 'I really like images where the hot spots (in this case the lights) are right on the edge of being over done. All the lighting just enhance what is already a great image. Well done.', '2013-01-05 16:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949779, 1047843, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wow - that is a great star shot for 40 minutes. I like the way the foreground is showing some detail as it gives the image some context.  A very competent capture - well done.</td>', 'Wow - that is a great star shot for 40 minutes. I like the way the foreground is showing some detail as it gives the image some context.  A very competent capture - well done.', '2013-01-05 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949782, 1047836, 101256, '<td valign="top">I assume that this was taken with ambient light in a dark room which is quite remarkable given that there is a lot of detail and very little shadow. Very competent capture. Well done.</td>', 'I assume that this was taken with ambient light in a dark room which is quite remarkable given that there is a lot of detail and very little shadow. Very competent capture. Well done.', '2013-01-05 16:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949783, 1046762, 101256, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t know what to say about this. To me, its just an amorphous mass or blob of...well, I don''t know. It''s a five for participation.</td>', 'I honestly don''t know what to say about this. To me, its just an amorphous mass or blob of...well, I don''t know. It''s a five for participation.', '2013-01-05 16:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949784, 1047078, 109387, '<td valign="top">IMO it would be better to use the title to tell a story than to show how long the exposure was. It could be a wonderful idea. But I appreciate the effort :)</td>', 'IMO it would be better to use the title to tell a story than to show how long the exposure was. It could be a wonderful idea. But I appreciate the effort :)', '2013-01-05 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949785, 1047849, 109387, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I''m sure it can score very well.</td>', 'Beautiful! I''m sure it can score very well.', '2013-01-05 16:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949788, 1046839, 108069, '<td valign="top">Spooky. Well done to get a very convincing effect.</td>', 'Spooky. Well done to get a very convincing effect.', '2013-01-05 16:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949789, 1047437, 101256, '<td valign="top">As I''ve said before, I''m not a big fan of the whole flowing water/long exposure genre of photography.  There is something to be said for the technique, but it is often over done - like sunsets and sunrises it becomes common and the effect loses its punch. In this case, there is some detail so that saves it - a little. A little less time and more detail would have made this a first class image.</td>', 'As I''ve said before, I''m not a big fan of the whole flowing water/long exposure genre of photography.  There is something to be said for the technique, but it is often over done - like sunsets and sunrises it becomes common and the effect loses its punch. In this case, there is some detail so that saves it - a little. A little less time and more detail would have made this a first class image.', '2013-01-05 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949790, 1047858, 108069, '<td valign="top">Are these eyelashes I see here before me? I hope not, because it looks like an arc welder''s run amok.</td>', 'Are these eyelashes I see here before me? I hope not, because it looks like an arc welder''s run amok.', '2013-01-05 16:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949791, 1047716, 101256, '<td valign="top">What detail there is is crisp and sharp, but there isn''t enough of it to make a difference - it''s just a picture of Dubai. A closer look at the skyline or even picking one aspect of the skyline and focusing on that would have been better.</td>', 'What detail there is is crisp and sharp, but there isn''t enough of it to make a difference - it''s just a picture of Dubai. A closer look at the skyline or even picking one aspect of the skyline and focusing on that would have been better.', '2013-01-05 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949792, 1047853, 101256, '<td valign="top">Squiggly lines are squiggly lines - it might have been better to outline something with the lights or draw something - something interesting.</td>', 'Squiggly lines are squiggly lines - it might have been better to outline something with the lights or draw something - something interesting.', '2013-01-05 16:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949793, 1047853, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting elements here, and great colors. Convergence of the bottom flares is cool, and the line is interesting, and the touch of blue mist/smoke int he top left is a nice, nebulous, complimentary color to offset the yellow/orange. Nice title as well.</td>', 'Lots of interesting elements here, and great colors. Convergence of the bottom flares is cool, and the line is interesting, and the touch of blue mist/smoke int he top left is a nice, nebulous, complimentary color to offset the yellow/orange. Nice title as well.', '2013-01-05 16:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949795, 1047166, 101256, '<td valign="top">There really isn''t much to say about this one - simply outstanding. Great concept and execution. Well done.</td>', 'There really isn''t much to say about this one - simply outstanding. Great concept and execution. Well done.', '2013-01-05 16:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949799, 1047481, 108069, '<td valign="top">Amazing. But I think a different crop would have really helped hit the 30-second thing home.</td>', 'Amazing. But I think a different crop would have really helped hit the 30-second thing home.', '2013-01-05 16:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949809, 1047562, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sweet crop to maximize the abstract nature of this capture. Great lines everywhere. Cool stuff.</td>', 'Sweet crop to maximize the abstract nature of this capture. Great lines everywhere. Cool stuff.', '2013-01-05 17:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949818, 1047822, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones. Well composed to get the contrast and motion. Lovely photo.</td>', 'Beautiful tones. Well composed to get the contrast and motion. Lovely photo.', '2013-01-05 17:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949821, 1047856, 108069, '<td valign="top">It should be required that this is viewed for at least 30 seconds. What was at first a very nice design of tones and subtle contrast is now gaining meaning and identifiable objects are appearing, or at least my mind is constructing them. Very nice.</td>', 'It should be required that this is viewed for at least 30 seconds. What was at first a very nice design of tones and subtle contrast is now gaining meaning and identifiable objects are appearing, or at least my mind is constructing them. Very nice.', '2013-01-05 17:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949824, 1047265, 101256, '<td valign="top">Winter imagery is always difficult as trees are bare and contrasting color is hard to find. Plus, most photographers have trouble with making snow white rather than blue.  This is a good example of how it should be done - lots of nice pleasing colors, the mood is peaceful and relaxing and the snow is white. Very nice image - I''d like to see it place in the top ten.</td>', 'Winter imagery is always difficult as trees are bare and contrasting color is hard to find. Plus, most photographers have trouble with making snow white rather than blue.  This is a good example of how it should be done - lots of nice pleasing colors, the mood is peaceful and relaxing and the snow is white. Very nice image - I''d like to see it place in the top ten.', '2013-01-05 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949827, 1047846, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think color would have been better. This has an impressionist feel to it and color would have enhanced that effect.</td>', 'I think color would have been better. This has an impressionist feel to it and color would have enhanced that effect.', '2013-01-05 17:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949830, 1047805, 101256, '<td valign="top">Much like the flowing water technique, fireworks are fireworks - lots of color and not much else. In this case, some care was taken to get other interesting features and it works. The whole feel of the image is exciting and the colors are not blown through as often is the case. Nice image.</td>', 'Much like the flowing water technique, fireworks are fireworks - lots of color and not much else. In this case, some care was taken to get other interesting features and it works. The whole feel of the image is exciting and the colors are not blown through as often is the case. Nice image.', '2013-01-05 17:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949833, 1047471, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is one thing about this image that I''ll bet money nobody caught - the sail boat masts moving and creating a building image on the right. Very interesting the way it worked out - took me a minute to understand what I was looking at.  Which is what a photograph should do - create interest in the details. Well done.</td>', 'There is one thing about this image that I''ll bet money nobody caught - the sail boat masts moving and creating a building image on the right. Very interesting the way it worked out - took me a minute to understand what I was looking at.  Which is what a photograph should do - create interest in the details. Well done.', '2013-01-05 17:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949834, 1046839, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is one flaw, well at least it''s a flaw to me, and that''s the darker image of the subject at the top. It would have worked better if the entire body had the ghostly effect.</td>', 'There is one flaw, well at least it''s a flaw to me, and that''s the darker image of the subject at the top. It would have worked better if the entire body had the ghostly effect.', '2013-01-05 17:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949836, 1047860, 101256, '<td valign="top">I hate to say this, but as reflection shots go, this is rather pedestrian. It also look washed out - nothing terribly interesting to look at. I might have taken a little more time to grab something closer to place in the foreground so that the color could be more effectively used.</td>', 'I hate to say this, but as reflection shots go, this is rather pedestrian. It also look washed out - nothing terribly interesting to look at. I might have taken a little more time to grab something closer to place in the foreground so that the color could be more effectively used.', '2013-01-05 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949838, 1047704, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you caught the plasma ignition on the return stroke on of the strike. It''s not over done at all - interesting.</td>', 'Interesting that you caught the plasma ignition on the return stroke on of the strike. It''s not over done at all - interesting.', '2013-01-05 17:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949841, 1046879, 101256, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people know that this is the Welsh Atlantis?  :&gt;)<br/> <br/>Very nice image in particular with the title - which, again, I''m not sure anybody on my side of the pond would recognize. <br/> <br/>Very nice - I like it.</td>', 'I wonder how many people know that this is the Welsh Atlantis?  :>) Very nice image in particular with the title - which, again, I''m not sure anybody on my side of the pond would recognize.  Very nice - I like it.', '2013-01-05 17:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949843, 1047841, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing earth tones in minimal lighting conditions.  A very nice still life. Well done.</td>', 'Very pleasing earth tones in minimal lighting conditions.  A very nice still life. Well done.', '2013-01-05 17:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949846, 1047851, 101256, '<td valign="top">Or alternatively, Woody catching on fire and dancing. :&gt;)<br/> <br/>I love these and have been experimenting with these small wooden manikins myself.  Lots of fun if you take your time with them.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Or alternatively, Woody catching on fire and dancing. :>) I love these and have been experimenting with these small wooden manikins myself.  Lots of fun if you take your time with them. Well done.', '2013-01-05 17:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949847, 1047856, 101256, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what the author was attempting here. There isn''t any context in relationship with the title. Nothing here to comment on.</td>', 'I have no idea what the author was attempting here. There isn''t any context in relationship with the title. Nothing here to comment on.', '2013-01-05 17:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949848, 1047466, 101256, '<td valign="top">I might have ditched the towers and just gone with an image of the power generation plant - much more interesting and much more to look at.</td>', 'I might have ditched the towers and just gone with an image of the power generation plant - much more interesting and much more to look at.', '2013-01-05 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949849, 1047799, 101256, '<td valign="top">Oh - I can''t say a word about this one - absolutely stunning subject and conversion.  This is just a terrific image. Well done.</td>', 'Oh - I can''t say a word about this one - absolutely stunning subject and conversion.  This is just a terrific image. Well done.', '2013-01-05 17:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949856, 1047719, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is kind of an odd effect here - the stars look closer than the ridges. I know it''s perspective, but you don''t see it presented this way that often. Nice image.</td>', 'There is kind of an odd effect here - the stars look closer than the ridges. I know it''s perspective, but you don''t see it presented this way that often. Nice image.', '2013-01-05 17:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949857, 1047822, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like images where there is some context and this is a great example of that. The figured ice is beautiful and the very slight hint of color just enhances the whole effect.  Well done.</td>', 'I like images where there is some context and this is a great example of that. The figured ice is beautiful and the very slight hint of color just enhances the whole effect.  Well done.', '2013-01-05 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949860, 1047644, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice night shot of a city skyline. Nothing overt to complain about or comment on. Nice job.</td>', 'A very nice night shot of a city skyline. Nothing overt to complain about or comment on. Nice job.', '2013-01-05 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949861, 1047729, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very different and very interesting. I like the change in colors and the slight motion effect.</td>', 'Very different and very interesting. I like the change in colors and the slight motion effect.', '2013-01-05 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6949917, 1047805, 93809, '<td valign="top">fantastic image. I wish I would have thought of this idea in my town.  I know the perfect spot. -10</td>', 'fantastic image. I wish I would have thought of this idea in my town.  I know the perfect spot. -10', '2013-01-05 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950017, 1047507, 142615, '<td valign="top">my best one 10</td>', 'my best one 10', '2013-01-05 21:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950040, 1047845, 124815, '<td valign="top">Their gait is unmistakable even if the leash (funkier then ever) is new. They look like painted by Renoir.</td>', 'Their gait is unmistakable even if the leash (funkier then ever) is new. They look like painted by Renoir.', '2013-01-05 21:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950047, 1047844, 124815, '<td valign="top">yes, I know this place well but never so empty!</td>', 'yes, I know this place well but never so empty!', '2013-01-05 21:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950055, 1047078, 124815, '<td valign="top">I love the magician''s box here! <br/>(oh  yes, no stockings!)</td>', 'I love the magician''s box here! (oh  yes, no stockings!)', '2013-01-05 21:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950058, 1047846, 124815, '<td valign="top">romantic</td>', 'romantic', '2013-01-05 21:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950060, 1047704, 124815, '<td valign="top">wow, anthropomorphic! so bright it got scared of its own shadow, so to speak!</td>', 'wow, anthropomorphic! so bright it got scared of its own shadow, so to speak!', '2013-01-05 21:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950062, 1047471, 124815, '<td valign="top">These beautiful boats did not need so much sky; I would have cropped a lot from the top.</td>', 'These beautiful boats did not need so much sky; I would have cropped a lot from the top.', '2013-01-05 21:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950141, 1047849, 140305, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful and I love the starbursts from the street lights. Great job!</td>', 'The colors are beautiful and I love the starbursts from the street lights. Great job!', '2013-01-05 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950149, 1047437, 140305, '<td valign="top">Oh, if only we had some unfrozen water in these parts...LOL (not that I could duplicate this). Fantastic!</td>', 'Oh, if only we had some unfrozen water in these parts...LOL (not that I could duplicate this). Fantastic!', '2013-01-06 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950150, 1047851, 140305, '<td valign="top">Brave little soldier that he is :)</td>', 'Brave little soldier that he is :)', '2013-01-06 00:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950151, 1047287, 140305, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors!</td>', 'Incredible colors!', '2013-01-06 00:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6950152, 1047231, 140305, '<td valign="top">I''m familiar with that kind of scene. Oops, forgot to put the lawn chairs away:) Love the light on this.</td>', 'I''m familiar with that kind of scene. Oops, forgot to put the lawn chairs away:) Love the light on this.', '2013-01-06 00:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
