(6953885, 1047842, 152252, '<td valign="top">I hope it does great. Definitely my favorite in the challenge. Love the shadows, B&amp;W and the snow... Good job!</td>', 'I hope it does great. Definitely my favorite in the challenge. Love the shadows, B&W and the snow... Good job!', '2013-01-10 01:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6954000, 1047078, 30712, '<td valign="top">A well planned before, after and an in-between element.  Very well done.</td>', 'A well planned before, after and an in-between element.  Very well done.', '2013-01-10 06:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6954003, 1047851, 30712, '<td valign="top">I like the rustic looking candles but I would have scored higher if the toy showed some movement.  It is a dance after all and its body has the ability to bend.</td>', 'I like the rustic looking candles but I would have scored higher if the toy showed some movement.  It is a dance after all and its body has the ability to bend.', '2013-01-10 06:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6954004, 1046762, 30712, '<td valign="top">Sometimes blur works but it has to be obvious what things are.  This image lacks impact in that respect.  An element of sharpness somewhere would have lifted the picture I feel.</td>', 'Sometimes blur works but it has to be obvious what things are.  This image lacks impact in that respect.  An element of sharpness somewhere would have lifted the picture I feel.', '2013-01-10 06:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6954005, 1047855, 30712, '<td valign="top">A very busy tree picture in which the individual elements don''t have enough space to make a statement.  Maybe some colour would have separated the trees more.</td>', 'A very busy tree picture in which the individual elements don''t have enough space to make a statement.  Maybe some colour would have separated the trees more.', '2013-01-10 06:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
