(6954573, 1047494, 39427, '<td valign="top">I love the wave from the smoke stacks fading into the sky... in this instance I want more sky and instead of the bush/weeds... also you gotta clean your sensor or clone all those little spots out!!</td>', 'I love the wave from the smoke stacks fading into the sky... in this instance I want more sky and instead of the bush/weeds... also you gotta clean your sensor or clone all those little spots out!!', '2013-01-10 21:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
