(6954719, 1047842, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''ve been back to this a few dozen times over the week and now I will try to explain why I love it, and fail. I''m hypnotized by it. There''s a fantastic, peaceful motion to it that has me leaning in and into it. Really into it. I don''t want to be there; I <i>am</i> there, in the silence, the peace, the millions of miles from distractions and obligations. It''s a seemingly everyday moment that suddenly is realized as a special feeling. It''s hard to explain. It''s fantastic.</td>', 'I''ve been back to this a few dozen times over the week and now I will try to explain why I love it, and fail. I''m hypnotized by it. There''s a fantastic, peaceful motion to it that has me leaning in and into it. Really into it. I don''t want to be there; I am there, in the silence, the peace, the millions of miles from distractions and obligations. It''s a seemingly everyday moment that suddenly is realized as a special feeling. It''s hard to explain. It''s fantastic.', '2013-01-10 23:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
