(6954816, 1046879, 96530, '<td valign="top">This really is beautiful Clive, congrats on your HM :)<br/> <br/>On your 10-stop filter and exposure; be sure to check that your filter is actually 10-stops. You may have the same Lee "Big Stopper" 10-stop filter I have. I read that they can actually vary by a stop or so, and sure enough mine turned out to be 11-stops when I checked it. A good thing to know as one stop (even amongst ten) can make quite a difference.</td>', 'This really is beautiful Clive, congrats on your HM :) On your 10-stop filter and exposure; be sure to check that your filter is actually 10-stops. You may have the same Lee "Big Stopper" 10-stop filter I have. I read that they can actually vary by a stop or so, and sure enough mine turned out to be 11-stops when I checked it. A good thing to know as one stop (even amongst ten) can make quite a difference.', '2013-01-11 01:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
