(6954860, 1047649, 8759, '<td valign="top">Interesting: <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=101256" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Teafran</a> says The whites are blown through all over the image and that is very distracting.<br/> <br/>while <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=135697" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">GAP2012</a> says needs longer exposure imo. Maybe my monitor needs calibration. <br/> <br/>The middle of the image might by a little too dead from a compositional standpoint as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=39427" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AP</a> pointed out but could not have been avoided. It''s a hill where a cemetery is located and. <br/> <br/>The image looks far better larger, IMO<br/> <br/>Thnx for comments<br/> <br/>T</td>', 'Interesting:   Teafran says The whites are blown through all over the image and that is very distracting. while   GAP2012 says needs longer exposure imo. Maybe my monitor needs calibration.  The middle of the image might by a little too dead from a compositional standpoint as  AP pointed out but could not have been avoided. It''s a hill where a cemetery is located and.  The image looks far better larger, IMO Thnx for comments T', '2013-01-11 02:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
