(6955913, 1047845, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- I was going to comment on 5 pictures, and write poems for all 5. Considering the fact that I have an incredible headache, you should be very impressed. However, as I stared at this, the etching of the chicken on top of the left dog was wayyyyy too distracting, and the poem just dissipated. Now I am going to spend my entire night thinking about the etching of the chicken, and be completely unable to write poetry, and it''s all your fault!</td>', 'Ok -- I was going to comment on 5 pictures, and write poems for all 5. Considering the fact that I have an incredible headache, you should be very impressed. However, as I stared at this, the etching of the chicken on top of the left dog was wayyyyy too distracting, and the poem just dissipated. Now I am going to spend my entire night thinking about the etching of the chicken, and be completely unable to write poetry, and it''s all your fault!', '2013-01-12 19:51:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6955933, 1047845, 96751, '<td valign="top">That leash seals the deal! Great pov. Creatures via etch-a-sketch.</td>', 'That leash seals the deal! Great pov. Creatures via etch-a-sketch.', '2013-01-12 20:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
