(6956131, 1047078, 91360, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rooum:</b></div><hr/><i> Great image Paul. Love the ghostly figure in the centre as well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yeap</td>', 'Originally posted by rooum: Great image Paul. Love the ghostly figure in the centre as well.   yeap', '2013-01-13 02:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6956204, 1047844, 59737, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, so many things going on to look at</td>', 'Very nice image, so many things going on to look at', '2013-01-13 08:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6956288, 1047841, 147861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MrJear:</b></div><hr/><i> I keep looking at it trying to find out the reason for such a low score, cant find it. In my opinion this is underrated. good job!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks.  I was a bit surprised at the low score as well, since I felt this was one of my better submissions.  I suppose people may have thought it was too dark, but that was sort of what I was going for - with the baskets coming out of the negative space of the background.  Anyway, thans for your kind comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by MrJear: I keep looking at it trying to find out the reason for such a low score, cant find it. In my opinion this is underrated. good job!!   Thanks.  I was a bit surprised at the low score as well, since I felt this was one of my better submissions.  I suppose people may have thought it was too dark, but that was sort of what I was going for - with the baskets coming out of the negative space of the background.  Anyway, thans for your kind comments.', '2013-01-13 12:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6956381, 1047471, 100393, '<td valign="top">Got a 9 from me. It is a lovely one; boats like brush strokes.</td>', 'Got a 9 from me. It is a lovely one; boats like brush strokes.', '2013-01-13 14:17:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6957140, 1047078, 59029, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Very well done, of course.   Congrats on a nude ribboning here!  :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>+1 Hope you gave her a print of this too!</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Very well done, of course.   Congrats on a nude ribboning here!  :D   +1 Hope you gave her a print of this too!', '2013-01-14 11:30:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6957209, 1047649, 138253, '<td valign="top">i see what you meant in the forums about you and your daughter disagreeing.<br/>i quite liked the image. I think there are a few things i might have changed had i taken this myself (cropped about 5-10% more from the top so that the lights on the left give the impression of continuing on and not ending on dead space the same way), but i think it''s a very well done overall image and the placement/score are representative of that.<br/>the layers work well here, and i don''t feel that it''s underexposed in the middle - if there''s no light there''s no light... you can see the odd light in the zone which gives credit to the fact that there''s "something" there, it''s just not illuminated and adds to the depth.</td>', 'i see what you meant in the forums about you and your daughter disagreeing.i quite liked the image. I think there are a few things i might have changed had i taken this myself (cropped about 5-10% more from the top so that the lights on the left give the impression of continuing on and not ending on dead space the same way), but i think it''s a very well done overall image and the placement/score are representative of that.the layers work well here, and i don''t feel that it''s underexposed in the middle - if there''s no light there''s no light... you can see the odd light in the zone which gives credit to the fact that there''s "something" there, it''s just not illuminated and adds to the depth.', '2013-01-14 12:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6957400, 1047078, 30214, '<td valign="top">congrats Paul! nice concept, I love the middle "panel"</td>', 'congrats Paul! nice concept, I love the middle "panel"', '2013-01-14 18:34:21.000000', NULL, 0),
